## 3. `.qwen/settings.json` (Project Root)

Project-level Qwen configuration.

```json
{
  "contextFileName": "QWEN.md",
  "autoMemoryEnabled": true,
  "projectMemoryEnabled": true,
  "checkpointingEnabled": true,
  "fileFilteringRespectGitIgnore": true,
  "excludeTools": [],
  "coreTools": [
    "read_file",
    "write_file",
    "edit",
    "run_shell_command",
    "search_file_content",
    "glob",
    "save_memory"
  ],
  "approvalMode": "default"
}
